 fill=\"#334155\" class=\"st\">Blue names who or what. Orange tells what happened.</text></g></svg>",
        "alt": "Animated cartoon: two birds bob and flap on a swaying branch, music notes rise one after another, and labels name the who or what and the doing part.",
