    {
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 310\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><style>@keyframes legA{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-24deg)}50%{transform:rotate(26deg)}}@keyframes legB{0%,100%{transform:rotate(26deg)}50%{transform:rotate(-24deg)}}@keyframes armA{0%,100%{transform:rotate(22deg)}50%{transform:rotate(-26deg)}}@keyframes armB{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-26deg)}50%{transform:rotate(22deg)}}@keyframes waveArm{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-6deg)}50%{transform:rotate(-40deg)}}@keyframes wag{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-18deg)}50%{transform:rotate(18deg)}}@keyframes flap{0%,100%{transform:scaleY(1)}50%{transform:scaleY(.4)}}@keyframes sway{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-2.5deg)}50%{transform:rotate(2.5deg)}}@keyframes drift{0%{transform:translateX(-12px)}100%{transform:translateX(14px)}}@keyframes spin{0%{transform:rotate(0)}100%{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@keyframes bob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-3px)}}@keyframes bite{0%,100%{transform:scaleY(1)}50%{transform:scaleY(.5)}}@keyframes rise{0%{transform:translateY(6px) scale(.6);opacity:0}18%{opacity:1}100%{transform:translateY(-54px) scale(1);opacity:0}}@keyframes fall{0%{transform:translateY(-14px);opacity:0}18%{opacity:1}100%{transform:translateY(26px);opacity:0}}@keyframes pop{0%{transform:scale(.5);opacity:0}55%{transform:scale(1.1);opacity:1}100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1}}@keyframes blink{0%,90%,100%{transform:scaleY(1)}94%{transform:scaleY(.1)}}@keyframes ripple{0%,100%{transform:scaleX(1);opacity:.7}50%{transform:scaleX(1.2);opacity:1}}@keyframes float{0%{transform:translate(0,0)}50%{transform:translate(4px,-3px)}100%{transform:translate(-3px,2px)}}@keyframes jump{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}30%{transform:translateY(-14px)}}.b2{animation:pop .6s ease-out both;animation-delay:0.5s}.b3{animation:pop .6s ease-out both;animation-delay:1.3s}.wbaL{animation:armB 1.2800000000000002s ease-in-out infinite;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:50% 0%}.wbaR{animation:waveArm 0.8s ease-in-out infinite;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:50% 0%}.wbhd{animation:bob 0.8s ease-in-out infinite}.wbey{animation:blink 4.2s linear infinite;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:50% 50%}.wbbd{animation:bob 0.8s ease-in-out infinite}.bb0{animation:rise 2.8s ease-out infinite;animation-delay:0.00s}.bb1{animation:rise 2.8s ease-out infinite;animation-delay:0.60s}.bb2{animation:rise 2.8s ease-out infinite;animation-delay:1.20s}.bb3{animation:rise 2.8s ease-out infinite;animation-delay:1.80s}.sb{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.scn *{animation:none !important}animate{display:none}}</style><g class=\"scn\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"720\" height=\"310\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#eef2ff\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"54\" width=\"380\" height=\"44\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e5e7eb\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1f2937\" class=\"sb\">Laughed and laughed.</text><g class=\"b2\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"118\" width=\"470\" height=\"44\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#dbeafe\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e40af\" class=\"sb\">The baby laughed and laughed.</text></g><g class=\"b3\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"182\" width=\"560\" height=\"44\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#dcfce7\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#166534\" class=\"sb\">The baby laughed and laughed in the bath.</text></g><rect x=\"560\" y=\"238\" width=\"128\" height=\"46\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"620\" y1=\"258\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"244.8\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"628\" y1=\"258\" x2=\"628\" y2=\"244.8\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g class=\"wbbd\"><rect x=\"614.8\" y=\"227\" width=\"18.5\" height=\"20.5\" rx=\"7.3\" fill=\"#fbbf24\"/><g class=\"wbaL\"><line x1=\"615.4\" y1=\"230.3\" x2=\"612.8\" y2=\"242.2\" stroke=\"#f2c79b\" stroke-width=\"3.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><g class=\"wbaR\"><line x1=\"632.6\" y1=\"230.3\" x2=\"641.2\" y2=\"215.8\" stroke=\"#f2c79b\" stroke-width=\"3.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><g class=\"wbhd\"><circle cx=\"624\" cy=\"217.1\" r=\"9.2\" fill=\"#4a3520\"/><circle cx=\"624\" cy=\"219.1\" r=\"8.6\" fill=\"#f2c79b\"/><g class=\"wbey\"><circle cx=\"621\" cy=\"217.7\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#1f2937\"/><circle cx=\"627\" cy=\"217.7\" r=\"1.3\" fill=\"#1f2937\"/></g><path d=\"M621.4 221.7 q2.6 3.0 5.3 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1f2937\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g></g><g class=\"bb0\"><circle cx=\"590\" cy=\"214\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"bb1\"><circle cx=\"608\" cy=\"206\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"bb2\"><circle cx=\"626\" cy=\"214\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"bb3\"><circle cx=\"644\" cy=\"206\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></g></svg>",
      "alt": "Animated cartoon: a baby waves in a bath as bubbles rise, and the fragment Laughed and laughed builds into The baby laughed and laughed in the bath.",
      "caption": "Watch the baby appear and the bubbles rise as the fragment becomes a clear, detailed sentence."
